This is ksni 0.3.6 (https://github.com/iovxw/ksni, public domain under the Unlicense, see
UNLICENSE) with one addition: the StatusNotifierItem method ProvideXdgActivationToken, which
KDE Plasma 6 and GNOME's AppIndicator extension call just before Activate. With it the tray's
panel window gets the token it needs to open in front and receive focus (GNOME otherwise opens
it in the background). Search for "provide_xdg_activation_token" for the change.
